M1: 1 pt", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 338.0205078125, 244.41383361816406, 351.5877380371094]}, {"text": "For two correct ticks: 0.5 pt; If only one correct tick given: 0.25 pt", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 349.9754943847656, 417.27349853515625, 363.542724609375]}, {"text": "-0.25 pt penalty for each incorrect tick, but not below 0 pt.", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 361.93048095703125, 384.7378234863281, 375.4977111816406]}, {"text": "For composition of M2: 1 pt; For two correct ticks: 0.5 pt; If only one correct tick", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 373.8854675292969, 480.58642578125, 387.4537048339844]}, {"text": "given: 0.25 pt", "bbox": [114.69098663330078, 385.8414611816406, 178.42015075683594, 399.40869140625]}, {"text": "-0.25 pt penalty for each incorrect tick, but not below 0 pt.", "bbox": [114.69098663330078, 397.79644775390625, 384.7378234863281, 411.3636779785156]}, {"text": "For relationship: 1 pt.", "bbox": [114.69098663330078, 409.7514343261719, 215.16444396972656, 423.31866455078125]}, {"text": "3.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 166.10049438476562, 521.8194580078125, 179.667724609375]}, {"text": "An ammonia production complex with a capacity of 660, 000 tons per year was commissioned at the", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 424.5269775390625, 538.575439453125, 459.11712646484375]}, {"text": "Navoiazot plant in Uzbekistan, which operates with a 97.0% of overall yield.", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 436.4819641113281, 401.7815246582031, 471.0721130371094]}]}, {"page": 3, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q7-3", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "7.2", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 166.2294921875, 92.84233856201172, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "Calculate the mass of CH4 (tons) required annually to produce 660, 000 tons of", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 151.31396484375, 480.5768127441406, 185.90411376953125]}, {"text": "ammonia, if the Navoiazot operates according to the Fig. 1.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 178.18450927734375, 390.5526428222656, 191.75173950195312]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 190.1405029296875, 169.74588012695312, 203.70773315429688]}, {"text": "𝑛(NH3) = 6.6⋅1011", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 186.85272216796875, 191.12008666992188, 224.69912719726562]}, {"text": "17", "bbox": [171.53199768066406, 197.44821166992188, 180.49839782714844, 228.57955932617188]}, {"text": "= 3.88 ⋅1010 mol", "bbox": [195.58200073242188, 188.68020629882812, 269.8118896484375, 224.6990966796875]}, {"text": "𝑛(N2, init.) = 3.88⋅1010", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 213.56170654296875, 212.3390655517578, 251.40811157226562]}, {"text": "2⋅0.97", "bbox": [183.6230010986328, 224.15721130371094, 206.36180114746094, 255.28855895996094]}, {"text": "= 2 ⋅1010 mol", "bbox": [216.80099487304688, 215.3892059326172, 278.577880859375, 251.40811157226562]}, {"text": "𝑛(H2, init.) = 3 ⋅2 ⋅1010 = 6 ⋅1010 mol", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 236.74295043945312, 284.25689697265625, 275.319091796875]}, {"text": "𝑛(O2) = 2 ⋅1010 ⋅1", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 260.6529541015625, 196.68319702148438, 299.2290954589844]}, {"text": "4 = 5 ⋅109 mol", "bbox": [192.1999969482422, 263.209228515625, 257.93988037109375, 304.0111083984375]}, {"text": "1 ⋅1010", "bbox": [119.6719970703125, 298.9952392578125, 150.8603973388672, 335.01513671875]}, {"text": "5 ⋅109", "bbox": [178.10800170898438, 298.9952392578125, 204.81320190429688, 335.01513671875]}, {"text": "1 ⋅1010", "bbox": [234.46200561523438, 298.9952392578125, 265.6494140625, 335.01513671875]}, {"text": "2 ⋅1010", "bbox": [292.89703369140625, 298.9952392578125, 324.08544921875, 335.01513671875]}, {"text": "2CH4", "bbox": [123.37301635742188, 318.8009948730469, 147.15980529785156, 353.3911437988281]}, {"text": "+", "bbox": [161.32101440429688, 318.8009948730469, 168.14540100097656, 353.3911437988281]}, {"text": "O2", "bbox": [185.0080108642578, 333.7165222167969, 197.9127960205078, 349.89788818359375]}, {"text": "→", "bbox": [215.27401733398438, 318.8009948730469, 224.4993896484375, 353.3911437988281]}, {"text": "2CO", "bbox": [240.768310546875, 318.8009948730469, 259.83380126953125, 353.3911437988281]}, {"text": "+", "bbox": [276.1100158691406, 318.8009948730469, 282.93438720703125, 353.3911437988281]}, {"text": "4H2", "bbox": [299.7413024902344, 318.8009948730469, 317.23779296875, 353.3911437988281]}, {"text": "𝑥", "bbox": [126.58500671386719, 348.28997802734375, 132.06443786621094, 382.880126953125]}, {"text": "𝑥", "bbox": [219.96200561523438, 348.28997802734375, 225.44143676757812, 382.880126953125]}, {"text": "3𝑥", "bbox": [260.25201416015625, 348.28997802734375, 270.7127380371094, 382.880126953125]}, {"text": "CH4", "bbox": [119.67201232910156, 381.58251953125, 138.4788055419922, 397.7068786621094]}, {"text": "+", "bbox": [148.9390106201172, 366.6669921875, 155.76339721679688, 401.25714111328125]}, {"text": "H2O", "bbox": [165.72601318359375, 381.58251953125, 186.51443481445312, 397.7638854980469]}, {"text": "→", "bbox": [196.47702026367188, 366.6669921875, 205.702392578125, 401.25714111328125]}, {"text": "CO", "bbox": [215.66500854492188, 381.58251953125, 229.73977661132812, 395.1497497558594]}, {"text": "+", "bbox": [239.7010040283203, 366.6669921875, 246.525390625, 401.25714111328125]}, {"text": "3H2", "bbox": [256.47802734375, 366.6669921875, 273.97979736328125, 401.25714111328125]}, {"text": "𝑥+ 1 ⋅1010", "bbox": [119.67300415039062, 394.72723388671875, 167.5924072265625, 430.7461242675781]}, {"text": "𝑥+ 1 ⋅1010", "bbox": [291.22698974609375, 394.72723388671875, 339.14642333984375, 430.7461242675781]}, {"text": "CO", "bbox": [136.84498596191406, 429.4485168457031, 150.91976928710938, 443.0157470703125]}, {"text": "+", "bbox": [178.052978515625, 414.5329895019531, 184.8773651123047, 449.1231384277344]}, {"text": "H2O", "bbox": [194.83999633789062, 429.4485168457031, 215.62840270996094, 445.6288757324219]}, {"text": "→", "bbox": [225.5909881591797, 414.5329895019531, 234.8163604736328, 449.1231384277344]}, {"text": "CO2", "bbox": [244.77899169921875, 429.4485168457031, 263.978759765625, 445.6288757324219]}, {"text": "+", "bbox": [274.4389953613281, 414.5329895019531, 281.26336669921875, 449.1231384277344]}, {"text": "H2", "bbox": [308.9309997558594, 429.4485168457031, 321.4417724609375, 445.6288757324219]}, {"text": "6 ⋅1010 = 2 ⋅1010 + 3𝑥+ 𝑥+ 1 ⋅1010", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 440.115966796875, 271.3094482421875, 478.6921081542969]}, {"text": "𝑥= 7.5 ⋅109", "bbox": [114.69102478027344, 466.5832214355469, 166.7072296142578, 502.60211181640625]}, {"text": "𝑚(CH4) = (7.5 ⋅109 + 1 ⋅1010) ⋅0.016 ⋅10−3 = 280, 000 tons", "bbox": [114.69102478027344, 482.01910400390625, 369.6772766113281, 547.9714965820312]}, {"text": "m(CH4)−", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 522.7349853515625, 156.77040100097656, 558.3931274414062]}, {"text": "−280,000 tons", "bbox": [149.94601440429688, 523.802978515625, 217.31350708007812, 559.4611206054688]}, {"text": "For 𝑛(NH3): 0.5 pt, for n 𝑛(N2, 𝑖𝑛𝑖𝑡.): 0.5 pt, for 𝑛(H2, 𝑖𝑛𝑖𝑡.): 0.5 pt, for 𝑛(O2, 𝑖𝑛𝑖𝑡.):", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 545.7210083007812, 480.58465576171875, 581.8995361328125]}, {"text": "0.5 pt, for correct equation to calculate 𝑛(CH4): 3 pt, for 𝑛(CH4) from equation:", "bbox": [114.6910400390625, 557.6759643554688, 480.5714111328125, 593.8545532226562]}, {"text": "1 pt, for 𝑚(CH4): 2 pt.", "bbox": [114.6910400390625, 569.6309814453125, 213.28810119628906, 605.8095703125]}, {"text": "8.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 166.15451049804688, 521.8194580078125, 179.72174072265625]}]}, {"page": 4, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q7-4", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "Consider a model of a real reaction system, which includes recirculation of reagents. An open system", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 155.21949768066406, 538.5646362304688, 168.78672790527344]}, {"text": "operates in a cyclic mode. Each cycle consists of four steps:", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 167.17449951171875, 332.52813720703125, 180.74172973632812]}, {"text": "1. A stoichiometric N2 : H2 = 1 : 3 mixture with a total amount of n0 mol is fed into the reactor after", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 185.1074981689453, 538.5800170898438, 201.1657257080078]}, {"text": "each cycle.", "bbox": [81.60000610351562, 197.0625, 131.83209228515625, 210.62973022460938]}, {"text": "2. The reaction proceeds with a constant yield of 𝜂= 0.150.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 200.07997131347656, 342.89794921875, 234.67010498046875]}, {"text": "3. Ammonia is separated by liquification.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 232.92849731445312, 260.1802978515625, 246.4957275390625]}, {"text": "4. Unreacted gases are returned into the reactor.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 250.86050415039062, 299.5723876953125, 264.427734375]}, {"text": "The cycle is repeated until the required overall yield is reached.", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 268.79351806640625, 350.3114318847656, 282.3607482910156]}, {"text": "Fig. 2. M2. – Mixture 2, CLR - cooler.", "bbox": [212.4250030517578, 388.635498046875, 382.8464660644531, 402.2027282714844]}]}, {"page": 5, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q7-5", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "7.3", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 166.2294921875, 92.84233856201172, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "a) Calculate the amount of nitrogen, present in the system after the 58th cycle", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 166.2294921875, 480.5833740234375, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "(before the addition of 59th portion of mixture), if 𝑛0 = 4 mol. Provide 4 decimal", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 163.26898193359375, 480.5764465332031, 199.44757080078125]}, {"text": "places. Hint: a formula for the sum of the terms of a geometric progression is", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 190.1405029296875, 480.57940673828125, 203.70773315429688]}, {"text": "needed.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 202.0955047607422, 149.45909118652344, 215.66273498535156]}, {"text": "b) Calculate the number of cycles needed to increase the overall yield from", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 214.05050659179688, 480.5923156738281, 227.61773681640625]}, {"text": "15.0% to 97.0%.", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 226.00550842285156, 188.2455291748047, 239.57273864746094]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 237.9604949951172, 169.74588012695312, 251.52772521972656]}, {"text": "Each time, along with the unreacted gases, a stoichiometric mixture of N2 and", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 249.91549682617188, 480.5822448730469, 265.9737243652344]}, {"text": "H2 is added to the synthesis reactor. Let's define 𝑓𝑛as the number of moles of", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 246.95596313476562, 480.57086181640625, 283.1335754394531]}, {"text": "N2, which are present in the reactor after the reaction and before adding the", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 273.82647705078125, 480.56072998046875, 289.5928649902344]}, {"text": "next portion. For moles of N2, the following recurrence relation is obtained:", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 285.781494140625, 468.2261047363281, 301.5478515625]}, {"text": "𝑓𝑛= (𝑛0", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 280.8631896972656, 150.48904418945312, 320.25054931640625]}, {"text": "4 + 𝑓𝑛−1)(1 −𝜂),", "bbox": [144.2760009765625, 284.07196044921875, 218.19766235351562, 323.44512939453125]}, {"text": "𝑓1 = (1 −𝜂)𝑛0", "bbox": [229.8240203857422, 280.86322021484375, 290.18304443359375, 321.15313720703125]}, {"text": "4 (2 pt each)", "bbox": [283.9700012207031, 291.4112243652344, 344.0867004394531, 322.5425720214844]}, {"text": "Applying the relation and using 𝑛0 = 4, we obtain:", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 297.41998291015625, 345.2428283691406, 334.5011291503906]}, {"text": "𝑓2 = (1 + 𝑓1)(1 −𝜂) = (1 −𝜂) + (1 −𝜂)2", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 309.6502380371094, 282.58819580078125, 348.1611328125]}, {"text": "𝑓3 = (1 + 𝑓2)(1 −𝜂) = (1 −𝜂) + (1 −𝜂)2 + (1 −𝜂)3", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 320.62799072265625, 326.6722412109375, 361.69512939453125]}, {"text": "𝑓4 = (1 + 𝑓3)(1 −𝜂) = (1 −𝜂) + (1 −𝜂)2 + (1 −𝜂)3 + (1 −𝜂)4", "bbox": [114.69102478027344, 334.2879943847656, 370.75628662109375, 375.3541259765625]}, {"text": "...", "bbox": [114.69107055664062, 365.1435241699219, 122.70166015625, 378.71075439453125]}, {"text": "𝑓𝑛= (1 −𝜂) + (1 −𝜂)2 + (1 −𝜂)3 + (1 −𝜂)4 + … + (1 −𝜂)𝑛=", "bbox": [114.69107055664062, 366.0090026855469, 372.5024719238281, 406.1725769042969]}, {"text": "𝑛", "bbox": [379.7491149902344, 359.8482360839844, 384.2054138183594, 390.9795837402344]}, {"text": "∑", "bbox": [375.5411071777344, 375.2149963378906, 388.41278076171875, 409.8051452636719]}, {"text": "𝑖=1", "bbox": [375.2701110839844, 384.8382263183594, 388.683837890625, 415.9695739746094]}, {"text": "(1 −𝜂)𝑖(2 pt)", "bbox": [388.6841125488281, 368.56524658203125, 447.29595947265625, 404.58514404296875]}, {"text": "= (1 −𝜂)1 −(1 −𝜂)𝑛", "bbox": [114.69110107421875, 392.04925537109375, 201.86940002441406, 434.68414306640625]}, {"text": "1 −(1 −𝜂) = (", "bbox": [155.80599975585938, 400.0939636230469, 223.3949432373047, 441.65911865234375]}, {"text": "1", "bbox": [224.5909881591797, 394.3149719238281, 229.57228088378906, 428.9051208496094]}, {"text": "𝜂−1) (1 −(1 −𝜂)𝑛) (2 pt)", "bbox": [224.59100341796875, 398.66522216796875, 339.2828674316406, 441.65911865234375]}, {"text": "a) After using the numerical values, we can easily calculate", "bbox": [114.69102478027344, 433.3914794921875, 387.5762634277344, 446.9587097167969]}, {"text": "𝑓𝑛= 5.6662 (2 pt)", "bbox": [114.69102478027344, 430.43194580078125, 192.40684509277344, 466.61053466796875]}, {"text": "If student calculated the answer by calculating every single 𝑓𝑛and got the final an-", "bbox": [114.69102478027344, 442.3869323730469, 480.57904052734375, 478.5655212402344]}, {"text": "swer correctly, full marks for the answer are given, but 0 for the equations.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 469.2574462890625, 444.4117736816406, 482.8246765136719]}, {"text": "For any other reasonable solution, giving the correct answer, full mark will be", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 481.2124328613281, 480.5672302246094, 494.7796630859375]}, {"text": "given.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 493.16741943359375, 142.8957977294922, 506.7346496582031]}, {"text": "b) Over n cycles, n moles of nitrogen have entered the system:", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 529.0333862304688, 405.8387145996094, 542.6005859375]}, {"text": "1 −𝜂𝑓𝑖𝑛𝑎𝑙=", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 546.807861328125, 166.42739868164062, 582.9864501953125]}, {"text": "(", "bbox": [170.3900146484375, 538.0899047851562, 177.86196899414062, 572.6800537109375]}, {"text": "1", "bbox": [179.05801391601562, 526.4728393554688, 184.039306640625, 561.06298828125]}, {"text": "𝜂−1) (1 −(1 −𝜂)𝑛)", "bbox": [179.05799865722656, 530.8232421875, 266.2745056152344, 573.817138671875]}, {"text": "𝑛", "bbox": [215.85699462890625, 553.781982421875, 220.80841064453125, 588.3721313476562]}, {"text": "(3 pt)", "bbox": [270.0579833984375, 561.7235107421875, 294.9458312988281, 575.2907104492188]}, {"text": "When 𝜂= 0.15 and 𝜂𝑓𝑖𝑛𝑎𝑙= 0.97, the exact answer is n = 188.9, so the required", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 562.427978515625, 480.5946350097656, 598.6065673828125]}, {"text": "number of cycles is 189 (2 pt).", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 589.2985229492188, 254.17440795898438, 602.86572265625]}, {"text": "Note: this equation can be easily converted to a linear one by mentioning that", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 601.2535400390625, 480.5877685546875, 614.8207397460938]}, {"text": "(1 −(1 −𝜂)𝑛) ≈1, which is practically true after n = 30. For any other reasonable", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 596.8642578125, 480.5912780761719, 632.8831787109375]}, {"text": "solution, giving the correct answer, full marks will be given.", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 625.16357421875, 376.2277526855469, 638.7307739257812]}, {"text": "𝑛= ___189____", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 622.2030029296875, 179.88107299804688, 656.7931518554688]}, {"text": "Total: 15 pt", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 659.0364990234375, 168.4014434814453, 672.6036987304688]}, {"text": "15.0 pt", "bbox": [495.1520080566406, 166.15451049804688, 526.921142578125, 179.72174072265625]}, {"text": "An aqueous solution of 3 is being used to remove CO2 from the mixture.", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 688.7274780273438, 395.6616516113281, 704.7857055664062]}]}, {"page": 6, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q7-6", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "7.4", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 166.2294921875, 92.84233856201172, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "Write the equation for this reaction.", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 166.2294921875, 283.9048156738281, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 178.18450927734375, 169.74588012695312, 191.75173950195312]}, {"text": "CO2 + H2O + (CH3)N(CH2CH2OH)2 −", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 175.2249755859375, 286.8133239746094, 212.30511474609375]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [283.03753662109375, 175.2249755859375, 289.8619079589844, 209.81512451171875]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [287.65020751953125, 175.2249755859375, 294.4745788574219, 209.81512451171875]}, {"text": "→(CH3)NH(CH2CH2OH)2+ + HCO3−", "bbox": [290.69879150390625, 171.23898315429688, 460.7239074707031, 209.81512451171875]}, {"text": "3 pt", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 212.0574951171875, 132.69183349609375, 225.62472534179688]}, {"text": "Any other reasonable reactions will be credited partially.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 233.97549438476562, 377.1763000488281, 247.542724609375]}, {"text": "3.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 166.15451049804688, 521.8194580078125, 179.72174072265625]}, {"text": "Complex 5 is obtained through the fixation of the molecular nitrogen according to the scheme below.", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 263.66650390625, 530.1485595703125, 277.2337341308594]}, {"text": "7.5", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 413.0715026855469, 92.84233856201172, 426.63873291015625]}, {"text": "Draw the structure of 5 using simplified scheme for the ligand. Note that 1.00", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 413.0715026855469, 480.5732727050781, 426.63873291015625]}, {"text": "g of 4 will react stoichiometrically with 94.97 cm3 of N2 at 273.15 K and 1.0 bar.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 423.9455261230469, 480.5804443359375, 443.9887390136719]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 439.8865051269531, 169.74588012695312, 453.4537353515625]}, {"text": "𝑛(N2) = 𝑃𝑉", "bbox": [126.4110107421875, 473.1022033691406, 176.56472778320312, 509.9181213378906]}, {"text": "𝑅𝑇= 100 × 0.09497", "bbox": [165.16799926757812, 473.1022033691406, 245.77671813964844, 513.7985229492188]}, {"text": "8.314 × 273.15 = 4.182 × 10−3 mol", "bbox": [193.34201049804688, 473.89923095703125, 335.2608947753906, 514.7011108398438]}, {"text": "𝑛(4) =", "bbox": [138.55001831054688, 499.23797607421875, 165.4165802001953, 533.828125]}, {"text": "1.00 g", "bbox": [190.177001953125, 496.1631774902344, 213.97242736816406, 527.2944946289062]}, {"text": "597.824 g mol−1 = 1.673 × 10−3 mol", "bbox": [169.38800048828125, 497.8092346191406, 323.1228942871094, 539.5765380859375]}, {"text": "𝑛(N2)", "bbox": [176.00100708007812, 522.5491943359375, 198.29681396484375, 553.6805419921875]}, {"text": "𝑛(4) = 4.182 × 10−3", "bbox": [179.37200927734375, 522.690673828125, 260.360595703125, 565.3681640625]}, {"text": "1.673 × 10−3 = 2.5", "bbox": [213.0469970703125, 525.9469604492188, 286.8592834472656, 565.9185791015625]}, {"text": "Thus, one molecule of the complex absorbs 2.5", "bbox": [121.06700897216797, 564.7734985351562, 340.5907287597656, 578.3406982421875]}, {"text": "moles of nitrogen, which means that two", "bbox": [135.04800415039062, 576.728515625, 326.60870361328125, 590.2957153320312]}, {"text": "molecules of the complex absorb 5 molecules", "bbox": [124.19300842285156, 588.6835327148438, 337.472412109375, 602.250732421875]}, {"text": "of nitrogen.", "bbox": [203.34201049804688, 600.6385498046875, 258.3262634277344, 614.2057495117188]}, {"text": "For calculating the ratio of nitrogen and complex: 3 pt, for correct structure", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 634.7365112304688, 480.5771484375, 648.3037109375]}, {"text": "(stereochemistry is not marked): 3 pt, for any other structures, fitting the ratio:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 646.6915283203125, 480.588134765625, 660.2587280273438]}, {"text": "1 pt", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 658.6475219726562, 132.69183349609375, 672.2147216796875]}, {"text": "If student found CORRECT structure but did not show calculations, full marks", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 670.6025390625, 480.5575866699219, 684.1697387695312]}, {"text": "will be given.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 682.5575561523438, 175.3539276123047, 696.124755859375]}, {"text": "6.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 412.9964904785156, 521.8194580078125, 426.563720703125]}, {"text": "The effect of different reductants and additives on the yield of NH3 was examined. The different Red", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 712.2484741210938, 538.5685424804688, 728.3067016601562]}, {"text": "and Ad combinations, their respective E° and 𝑝𝐾𝑎, together with the resulting NH3 yield are presented", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 709.2879638671875, 538.5845336914062, 745.466552734375]}, {"text": "below.", "bbox": [56.692962646484375, 736.1585083007812, 87.24891662597656, 749.7257080078125]}]}, {"page": 7, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "ocr", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [57.0, 67.5, 105.5, 82.0]}, {"text": "Chao", "bbox": [57.0, 83.5, 130.5, 110.5]}, {"text": "58th International", "bbox": [57.0, 114.0, 130.5, 120.5]}, {"text": "Chemistry Olympiad", "bbox": [56.5, 123.0, 130.5, 132.0]}, {"text": "Uzbekistan 2026", "bbox": [56.5, 132.0, 131.0, 139.5]}, {"text": "Q7-7", "bbox": [414.0, 79.5, 536.5, 130.0]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [462.0, 132.0, 535.5, 142.0]}, {"text": "# 1 2 3 4", "bbox": [136.5, 168.0, 434.5, 175.0]}, {"text": "“| & | & & &", "bbox": [140.5, 204.5, 439.5, 239.0]}, {"text": "E° (Vv) -0.88 1.15 1.15 -1.15", "bbox": [136.0, 250.0, 443.0, 263.5]}, {"text": "上 | Ce (-", "bbox": [184.0, 274.5, 442.0, 305.5]}, {"text": "a 7 +2 +.", "bbox": [203.5, 289.5, 436.0, 296.0]}, {"text": "Ad |Hgc~-N7 CH, | HsC™ ON CHe | HCW ON Hc ~N7 ~CHy", "bbox": [140.5, 290.5, 466.0, 309.5]}, {"text": "H H H H", "bbox": [198.0, 306.0, 436.5, 315.0]}, {"text": "CF;SO5 cr CFaSOs CF;SO5", "bbox": [187.5, 316.5, 451.0, 332.5]}, {"text": "pKa 14.4 144 13.9 14.4", "bbox": [135.0, 341.5, 442.0, 357.0]}, {"text": "NH yield", "bbox": [128.5, 371.5, 161.0, 379.0]}, {"text": "(mole) 0 07 9.1 11.8", "bbox": [129.5, 372.5, 441.0, 391.5]}]}, {"page": 8, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q7-8", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "7.6", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 166.2294921875, 92.84233856201172, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "Rank the following Red/Ad combinations A-D by the decrease in ammonia", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 166.2294921875, 480.5736389160156, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "yield.", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 178.18450927734375, 139.32916259765625, 191.75173950195312]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 424.21551513671875, 169.74588012695312, 437.7827453613281]}, {"text": "B>C>D>A=0", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 436.1715087890625, 170.46937561035156, 449.7387390136719]}, {"text": "A = 0: NiCp2 at −0.09 V is below the reductant threshold, so no NH3 is produced.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 448.1264953613281, 480.5839538574219, 464.1847229003906]}, {"text": "B>C: B benefits from a slightly higher 𝑝𝐾𝑎: stronger acids favour hydrogen evo-", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 445.16595458984375, 480.5750427246094, 481.34454345703125]}, {"text": "lution. It can be seen from the table as well (3 vs 4). (2 pt)", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 472.0364685058594, 381.6897888183594, 485.60369873046875]}, {"text": "C>D: Switching from OTf−to Cl−causes a large suppression because of the", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 467.6471862792969, 480.5604553222656, 498.7785339355469]}, {"text": "stronger coordination. This is shown in the table (2 vs 3). (2 pt)", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 495.9464416503906, 406.3238220214844, 509.513671875]}, {"text": "D>A: D gives small non-zero yield — Cl−suppresses heavily but the strong re-", "bbox": [114.6910400390625, 491.5571594238281, 480.5838623046875, 522.6884765625]}, {"text": "ductant and good 𝑝𝐾𝑎sustain some catalytic turnover (2), when A gives zero.", "bbox": [114.69102478027344, 504.94189453125, 480.5878601074219, 541.1204833984375]}, {"text": "(2 pt)", "bbox": [114.69107055664062, 531.8124389648438, 138.6691131591797, 545.379638671875]}, {"text": "Total: 6 pt", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 543.7675170898438, 161.7926025390625, 557.334716796875]}, {"text": "6.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 166.15451049804688, 521.8194580078125, 179.72174072265625]}, {"text": "Nitrogen fixation can also be achieved via binary nitrides (compounds containing N3−). Such nitrides 7,", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 557.1142578125, 538.5826416015625, 588.2455444335938]}, {"text": "8, 9 were obtained from pure elements. When they are heated together with SiO2, red crystals of a stable", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 585.4135131835938, 538.57763671875, 601.179931640625]}, {"text": "compound 10 are formed as the single product. The minimal possible formula, describing the structure", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 597.3685302734375, 538.5596923828125, 610.9357299804688]}, {"text": "of compound 10 is Q𝛼R𝛽S2T[Si12N24]. In addition:", "bbox": [56.693031311035156, 594.4089965820312, 291.1836853027344, 630.5875854492188]}, {"text": "1. Mass fractions of nitrogen are 𝑤(N)7 =9.16%, 𝑤(N)8 =18.90%, 𝑤(N)9 =39.94%", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 612.3410034179688, 442.0718688964844, 649.43017578125]}, {"text": "2. Q and R are metal cations in their highest oxidation state.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 645.1895141601562, 350.72808837890625, 658.7567138671875]}, {"text": "3. S is a monoatomic anion.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 663.1224975585938, 198.94546508789062, 676.689697265625]}, {"text": "4. T is an anion with tetrahedral configuration.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 681.0554809570312, 287.01788330078125, 694.6226806640625]}, {"text": "5. For the quantitative formation of 10, the mass ratio 7 : 8 : 9 : SiO2 = 5.09 : 2.96 : 3.27 : 1.00.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 698.9874877929688, 507.1567077636719, 715.0457153320312]}]}, {"page": 9, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q7-9", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "7.7", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 166.2294921875, 92.84233856201172, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "Identify the empirical formulae of 7 – 10. Specify the composition of anions S", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 166.2294921875, 480.584228515625, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "and T.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 180.47549438476562, 143.59664916992188, 194.042724609375]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 192.43150329589844, 169.74588012695312, 205.9987335205078]}, {"text": "For binary nitride Z3N𝑛(we can suggest nitrogen as trivalent for the start):", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 194.51821899414062, 480.5753479003906, 225.64956665039062]}, {"text": "𝑤(N) =", "bbox": [114.6910171508789, 207.82797241210938, 146.20059204101562, 242.41812133789062]}, {"text": "14.007 × 𝑛(N)", "bbox": [175.31101989746094, 201.27297973632812, 232.66856384277344, 235.86312866210938]}, {"text": "14.007 × 𝑛(N) + 𝑀(Z) × 3, so 𝑀(Z) = 14.007", "bbox": [150.1719970703125, 202.0499725341797, 341.8421325683594, 249.39312744140625]}, {"text": "3", "bbox": [325.65301513671875, 214.802978515625, 330.6343078613281, 249.39312744140625]}, {"text": "(", "bbox": [344.6990051269531, 213.66598510742188, 352.17095947265625, 248.25613403320312]}, {"text": "1", "bbox": [361.8380126953125, 202.04998779296875, 366.8193054199219, 236.64013671875]}, {"text": "𝑤(N) −1) × 𝑛", "bbox": [353.3659973144531, 207.82797241210938, 415.9461669921875, 249.39312744140625]}, {"text": "For analysing mass fraction data let's create a table:", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 241.12649536132812, 356.56365966796875, 254.6937255859375]}, {"text": "n", "bbox": [138.8179931640625, 269.96649169921875, 144.9765167236328, 283.5337219238281]}, {"text": "𝑀(Z7)", "bbox": [203.8509979248047, 255.05096435546875, 232.716552734375, 289.64111328125]}, {"text": "𝑀(Z8)", "bbox": [307.677978515625, 255.05096435546875, 336.5435485839844, 289.64111328125]}, {"text": "𝑀(Z9)", "bbox": [411.5050048828125, 255.05096435546875, 440.37054443359375, 289.64111328125]}, {"text": "1", "bbox": [139.04901123046875, 285.906494140625, 144.7454071044922, 299.4737243652344]}, {"text": "46.30", "bbox": [205.55499267578125, 285.906494140625, 231.01719665527344, 299.4737243652344]}, {"text": "20.03", "bbox": [309.38201904296875, 285.906494140625, 334.84417724609375, 299.4737243652344]}, {"text": "7.02", "bbox": [416.0570068359375, 285.906494140625, 435.8205871582031, 299.4737243652344]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [139.04901123046875, 301.8475036621094, 144.7454071044922, 315.41473388671875]}, {"text": "92.61", "bbox": [205.55499267578125, 301.8475036621094, 231.01719665527344, 315.41473388671875]}, {"text": "40.07 (Ca3N2)", "bbox": [289.333984375, 286.9319763183594, 354.88653564453125, 321.5221252441406]}, {"text": "14.04", "bbox": [413.2090148925781, 301.8475036621094, 438.67120361328125, 315.41473388671875]}, {"text": "3", "bbox": [139.04901123046875, 317.7875061035156, 144.7454071044922, 331.354736328125]}, {"text": "138.909 (LaN)", "bbox": [185.97299194335938, 302.8719787597656, 250.5935516357422, 337.4621276855469]}, {"text": "60.105", "bbox": [306.53399658203125, 317.7875061035156, 337.6947937011719, 331.354736328125]}, {"text": "21.063", "bbox": [410.3609924316406, 317.7875061035156, 441.52178955078125, 331.354736328125]}, {"text": "4", "bbox": [139.04901123046875, 333.7275085449219, 144.7454071044922, 347.29473876953125]}, {"text": "185.21", "bbox": [202.70700073242188, 333.7275085449219, 233.86781311035156, 347.29473876953125]}, {"text": "80.14", "bbox": [309.38201904296875, 333.7275085449219, 334.84417724609375, 347.29473876953125]}, {"text": "28.08 (Si3N4)", "bbox": [395.1700134277344, 318.8119812011719, 456.7045593261719, 353.4021301269531]}, {"text": "5", "bbox": [139.04901123046875, 349.6675109863281, 144.7454071044922, 363.2347412109375]}, {"text": "231.52", "bbox": [202.70700073242188, 349.6675109863281, 233.86781311035156, 363.2347412109375]}, {"text": "100.18", "bbox": [306.53399658203125, 349.6675109863281, 337.6947937011719, 363.2347412109375]}, {"text": "35.11", "bbox": [413.2090148925781, 349.6675109863281, 438.67120361328125, 363.2347412109375]}, {"text": "6", "bbox": [139.04901123046875, 365.6084899902344, 144.7454071044922, 379.17572021484375]}, {"text": "277.82", "bbox": [202.70700073242188, 365.6084899902344, 233.86781311035156, 379.17572021484375]}, {"text": "120.21", "bbox": [306.53399658203125, 365.6084899902344, 337.6947937011719, 379.17572021484375]}, {"text": "42.13", "bbox": [413.2090148925781, 365.6084899902344, 438.67120361328125, 379.17572021484375]}, {"text": "7", "bbox": [139.04901123046875, 381.5484924316406, 144.7454071044922, 395.11572265625]}, {"text": "324.12", "bbox": [202.70700073242188, 381.5484924316406, 233.86781311035156, 395.11572265625]}, {"text": "140.24", "bbox": [306.53399658203125, 381.5484924316406, 337.6947937011719, 395.11572265625]}, {"text": "49.15", "bbox": [413.2090148925781, 381.5484924316406, 438.67120361328125, 395.11572265625]}, {"text": "8", "bbox": [139.04901123046875, 397.4884948730469, 144.7454071044922, 411.05572509765625]}, {"text": "370.42", "bbox": [202.70700073242188, 397.4884948730469, 233.86781311035156, 411.05572509765625]}, {"text": "160.28", "bbox": [306.53399658203125, 397.4884948730469, 337.6947937011719, 411.05572509765625]}, {"text": "56.19", "bbox": [413.2090148925781, 397.4884948730469, 438.67120361328125, 411.05572509765625]}, {"text": "After calculations and the use of the common chemical sense we get only 3", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 425.34149169921875, 480.57525634765625, 438.9087219238281]}, {"text": "possibilities: 7 = LaN, 8 = Ca3N2, 9 = Si3N4. Now let’s convert mass ratios to", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 437.2974853515625, 480.59307861328125, 453.0628356933594]}, {"text": "molar ones:", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 449.2524719238281, 170.133544921875, 462.8197021484375]}, {"text": "𝑛(LaN) ∶𝑛(Ca3N2) ∶𝑛(Si3N4) ∶𝑛(SiO2)", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 446.29193115234375, 287.0745544433594, 482.47052001953125]}, {"text": "5.09", "bbox": [133.52801513671875, 467.9761657714844, 149.21922302246094, 499.1075134277344]}, {"text": "138.91+14.01 ∶", "bbox": [115.88700103759766, 470.2019958496094, 175.91488647460938, 509.57513427734375]}, {"text": "2.96", "bbox": [202.32501220703125, 467.9762268066406, 218.01620483398438, 499.1075744628906]}, {"text": "40.07⋅3+14.01⋅2 ∶", "bbox": [179.87799072265625, 470.2019958496094, 249.51788330078125, 509.57513427734375]}, {"text": "3.27", "bbox": [275.9280090332031, 467.9762268066406, 291.61920166015625, 499.1075744628906]}, {"text": "28.08⋅3+14.01⋅4 ∶", "bbox": [253.4810028076172, 470.2019958496094, 323.1208801269531, 509.57513427734375]}, {"text": "1", "bbox": [351.6109924316406, 467.9762268066406, 356.09417724609375, 499.1075744628906]}, {"text": "28.08+16.00⋅2 = 10 ∶6 ∶7 ∶5", "bbox": [327.083984375, 470.2019958496094, 450.9557189941406, 509.57513427734375]}, {"text": "So, the reaction of formation of 10 looks like:", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 509.02850341796875, 324.2300720214844, 522.595703125]}, {"text": "10 LaN + 6 Ca3N2 + 7 Si3N4 + 5 SiO2 ⟶…", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 518.02294921875, 310.86492919921875, 555.1041259765625]}, {"text": "Thus, the formula of 10 should be La10Ca18Si26N50O10.", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 556.8484497070312, 391.9206237792969, 572.6148071289062]}, {"text": "T should have a", "bbox": [401.2969970703125, 556.8484497070312, 480.5804748535156, 570.4156494140625]}, {"text": "tetrahedral configuration, which is really unlikely for both nitrogen and oxy-", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 568.8034057617188, 480.58526611328125, 582.37060546875]}, {"text": "gen, so anion T should have the formula SiX4𝑛−(𝑋might be different). As", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 564.4141845703125, 480.5659484863281, 600.43408203125]}, {"text": "we need to have two identical monoatomic anions, which cannot be obtained", "bbox": [114.69102478027344, 592.7144775390625, 480.5699157714844, 606.2816772460938]}, {"text": "from one atom of nitrogen, T = SiO3N5−, S = O2−.", "bbox": [114.69102478027344, 588.32421875, 363.6186828613281, 620.4359130859375]}, {"text": "So, the final answer is", "bbox": [371.9766540527344, 604.6694946289062, 480.57904052734375, 618.2366943359375]}, {"text": "10 = La5Ca9(O)2(NSiO3)[Si12N24].", "bbox": [114.69105529785156, 601.708984375, 274.4836730957031, 636.2991333007812]}, {"text": "for 7, 8, 9: 3 pt each (for 9 = Li3N 1 pt);", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 628.5795288085938, 293.2046813964844, 644.345947265625]}, {"text": "for 10: 4 pt if both S and T are emphasised, 2 pt for empirical formula.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 640.5345458984375, 441.14556884765625, 654.1017456054688]}, {"text": "13.0 pt", "bbox": [495.1520080566406, 166.15451049804688, 526.921142578125, 179.72174072265625]}]}]